    <span class="label">Operations executive · AI systems</span>
    <h1>I don't buy the AI stack. I build it.</h1>
    <p class="sub">Ten years owning operations and P&amp;L in high-velocity businesses — Uber&nbsp;Eats, Beat, Binance, OneLocal, ClickGuard. The last two years I stopped writing requirements for someone else to build and started shipping the systems myself: self-hosted agents, orchestrated pipelines with human approval gates, and the observability to know what any of it actually costs.</p>
    <p class="ai-proof"><strong>This page is the shortest version of the argument.</strong> It is served by the same Linux box described below — same Caddy config, same build pipeline, same deploy cron — from a static site I designed and wrote. Nothing on this page is a slide.</p>
  </div>
</section>

